---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bare Metal Private Clouds Made Easy! — Metify" description="MOJO Platform enables enterprises to take full advantage of their infrastructure investments by simplifying bare metal server management.">
  <article class="py-24 bg-brand-darker">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <a href="/blog" class="text-brand-green text-sm font-semibold hover:underline mb-8 inline-flex items-center">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" /></svg>
        Back to Blog
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-4">Bare Metal Private Clouds Made Easy!</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8">March 25, 2024 &middot; By Aaron Allred, VP of Technology</p>
      <img src="/images/blog/Cloud_Server.jpg" alt="Cloud Server Infrastructure" class="w-full rounded-xl mb-12" />

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">Bare Metal Servers have quickly become the preferred architecture for high-performance and modern edge applications.</p>

        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">Metify's MOJO Platform enables enterprises to take full advantage of their Infrastructure investments by greatly simplifying the Discovery, Provisioning, and Automation of those devices. From Sensor to Mainframe Server, MOJO Platform provides a stunningly simplified user experience that was not possible just a few years ago.</p>

        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">The new word that can now be spoken in the same sentence when discussing Bare Metal server deployments is <strong class="text-white">SIMPLICITY</strong>.</p>

        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">MOJO Platform enables customers to choose freely between Private or Public Clouds (AWS, GCP, IBM, Rackspace, etc) when provisioning their Bare Metal clouds.</p>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/trial" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-brand-green text-brand-darker font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-green-dark transition-all">
            Download Free Trial
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
